      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd love a system where you could have multiple categories that you choose to show or hide. Want to see night clubs? Show that. Want to hide Games? Go for it. The worlds menu is full of lists I don't use and the search bar pinned lists are useless because search is so bad. Favorites are located at the bottom, so i have to scroll through a bunch of lagy lists I don't care about to see them.\nI really hope the worlds menu in the new UI is customizable to a large degree so things like that can just be enabled/disabled.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
